From cadb60a2d6ab0068dbe7bd1783cc8d400d1144e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:41:42 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 055/230] Rebuild the static team seed from verified ESPN data
 and cap the picker at the Top 5
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The hand-written seed had drifted ESPN ids, so half the picker showed the
wrong crest and name; regenerate every row from the verified sync data
(big-five clubs + national sides) and lock it to the bundled manifests with
a test. Also drop the non-big-five league tabs from the favorites picker, as
the Onboarding flow now offers only the Top 5 plus Other/International.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
